# Environment variables referenced by MCP server configs in this marketplace.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. Never commit real secrets. Plugin .mcp.json files must
# reference secrets only via ${ENV_VAR} placeholders; put the real values in your
# shell profile / OS keychain on each machine, or copy this file to `.env` (gitignored)
# for local use.
#
# Add one line per variable as MCP servers are introduced, e.g.:
# CONTEXT7_API_KEY=
# GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN=
